# 🔥 5. Renewable Energy

India has become one of the world's leading renewable-energy nations, with strong growth in solar and other clean-energy capacity. ([Insights IAS][2])

### SSB Perspective

Benefits:

* Energy security
* Reduced pollution
* Sustainable development

